### Sample requests for the EWB Students CRUD API
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP client.
### Server assumed at http://localhost:8000

@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Create a student
POST {{base}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha Verma",
  "date_of_birth": "2004-06-15",
  "email": "asha.verma@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 98765 43210",
  "course": "Computer Science",
  "address": "Pune",
  "enrollment_date": "2022-08-01"
}

### List all students
GET {{base}}/students

### Filter: name contains "asha"
GET {{base}}/students?search=asha

### Filter: born after 2005-01-01
GET {{base}}/students?born_after=2005-01-01

### Filter: course + pagination
GET {{base}}/students?course=Computer%20Science&limit=10&offset=0

### View one student
GET {{base}}/students/1

### Update a student (partial / PATCH)
PATCH {{base}}/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "course": "Data Science"
}

### Replace-style update (PUT)
PUT {{base}}/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Asha Verma",
  "date_of_birth": "2004-06-15",
  "email": "asha.verma@example.com",
  "course": "AI & ML"
}

### Delete a student
DELETE {{base}}/students/1

### Optional AI question (requires Ollama running)
POST {{base}}/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How many students are there and how many were born after 2005?"
}
